{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"41245120e56015c5bd687d948b117ee6600664fa6afcc893647956a275f8db19","ja":"あっという間に行列をさばいて、今日の分は完売！\nああ～、茜ちゃんは自分のカリスマ性が怖いよっ！","zh":"一眨眼就应对完排队的长龙，今天的份全都卖光啦！\n啊啊～，小茜都害怕起自己的领袖魅力了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"862f9c1a33532840a8cbab9cd6581d2c4c4bcb190417b8846917ac6a59c72f2c","ja":"オフの日だったのに、すっかり1日店員に\nなっちゃったね。ふふ、でも楽しかったなあ♪","zh":"明明是休息日，却完全变成1日店员了\n呢。呵呵，不过挺开心的呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"e5e9814503ce4afdd6eebd6c1b3a7564b9652213ca95d2deb9c154dfd1212073","ja":"杏奈も……♪　CM見たよって……\nお客さんに……たくさん、声、かけてもらえたし。","zh":"杏奈也是……♪　客人们……\n也都对杏奈说……看了广告哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"6e152cc6bebbeffb9b50b4f0d8a4a7d75abb1dd3b2b58ed4fa895cc05271e53b","ja":"いっぱい……製菓会社さんの、力に……\nなれた……かな……？","zh":"帮上……点心公司……\n很多忙了……吧……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"379d11c66a6897856e35ee40e12eeb49c2cde872b8ca79bb5a629e86ff158120","ja":"うん、絶対なれたよ！　この勢いで、ホワイトデーも\n来年も、盛り上がってくれるといいよね！","zh":"嗯，绝对成功了！要是能借着这股势头，\n在白色情人节和明年也都这么热闹就好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"77b58ca108fe202673358b20091213554ddf5d2713f3b2e78bacf7b642f195e7","ja":"そだね！　アタシたちでこれからも\nバンバン盛り上げてこ！　SNSで宣伝とかもしてさ♪","zh":"就是说啊！我们今后也要\n轰轰烈烈地炒热气氛！还要在SNS上做宣传什么的哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"e59afdf800ba6e43bff66e58a060bdaba5be8aa071368c4ff8d157923b020a15","ja":"製菓会社さんのと～ってもおいしいチョコ、\nもっともっとみんなに知ってもらいたいもんねっ！","zh":"糕点公司超～级好吃的巧克力，\n真想让大家多多知道呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1010.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"cf32b51ee876b72f0b1ef45de27798afd778b076f2a1821867396fe49ab530f1","ja":"うん♪　じゃあ、今日のこともブログに載せよっか！？\nせっかくだから、みんなで写真撮ろ♪","zh":"嗯♪　那今天的事也发到博客上吧！？\n难得有机会，大家一起拍张照吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
